---
---

<section id="demo" class="py-20 bg-white border-t border-slate-200/70">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-2">Interface & Architecture</h2>
      <p class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">界面与架构展示</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base">直观精炼的终端 TUI 与强大的底层架构示意。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-stretch">
      <!-- Screenshot 1: Models & Connection -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-slate-900 text-white p-6 shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-slate-800 mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 ml-2">spark models · 模型探测与管理</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-indigo-400 bg-indigo-950/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-indigo-800/60">TUI</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 shadow-inner">
            <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/images/models.png`} alt="模型管理与连接测试" class="w-full h-auto object-cover hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-300" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          实时探测各服务商 API 端点健康度、可用模型列表及响应延迟，支持一键切换默认模型。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Screenshot 2: Architecture Diagram -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/90 bg-slate-900 text-white p-6 shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-4 border-b border-slate-800 mb-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
              <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 ml-2">spark architecture · 架构与路由流水线</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-xs font-mono text-emerald-400 bg-emerald-950/60 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-800/60">Core</span>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-800 bg-slate-950 p-2 shadow-inner">
            <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')}/images/spark-architecture.svg`} alt="Spark 架构设计" class="w-full h-auto object-contain" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          清晰解耦的统一网关、IR 中间表示与多 Agent 适配层，确保每一次调用零损耗且精准路由。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
